Source: pardus-ip-conflict-notifier
Section: net
Priority: optional
Maintainer: Emel Öztürk <emel.ozturk@pardus.org.tr>
Build-Depends: debhelper-compat (= 13), dh-python, python3-all, python3-setuptools, gettext
Standards-Version: 4.6.2
Homepage: https://github.com/pardus/pardus-ip-conflict-notifier
Rules-Requires-Root: no


Package: pardus-ip-conflict-notifier
Architecture: all
Depends: ${misc:Depends},
         ${python3:Depends},
         ipwatchd,
         libnotify-bin,
         systemd,
         util-linux
Provides: ipwatchd-gnotify
Conflicts: ipwatchd-gnotify
Replaces: ipwatchd-gnotify
Description: Desktop notification for IP address conflicts
 Shows a desktop notification to every local graphical user when ipwatchd
 detects an IPv4 address conflict, similar to the Windows warning.
 .
 Replaces ipwatchd-gnotify: installs /usr/sbin/ipwatchd-gnotify, which the
 stock /usr/sbin/ipwatchd-script already calls. No configuration is changed.